{"text": "Kowalczyk & Farrow CPAs, LLC                     2025 TAX ORGANIZER -- RENTAL REAL ESTATE (Schedule E)\nClient no. C-10447                              Preparer: B. Kowalczyk   Reviewer: IF\n\nTAXPAYER    Santos de Oliveira, Rafael      SSN 502-39-8615     DOB 11/02/1971\nSPOUSE      Santos, Mei-Ling                SSN 461261522       DOB 2 Feb 1974\nHome        18 Wappoo Creek Place, Charleston, SC 29412\nPhone       843 555 0177 (R)   843-555-0102 (M-L)      Email rafa.santos@santosrentals.example\n\nProperties are held in Santos Family Rentals LLC (disregarded; EIN 47-2290618) unless noted.\n\nPROPERTY A -- 212-B Ashley Avenue, Charleston 29403? (client wrote 29403, deed says 29401)\n  Type: duplex, both units long-term        Placed in service: 06/15/2014      Basis (bldg): $418,000\n  Rents received ........................ 52,800\n  Mgmt fees (Palmetto Coastal Property Management) ........ 5,280\n  Mortgage int. (Form 1098, Lowcountry Federal Savings Bank, loan #0091-447820) ... 9,611.48\n  Property tax .......................... 6,940\n  Insurance ............................. 4,125\n  Repairs -- see note 1 ................. 23,750\n  Depreciation (27.5 yrs, Form 4562) .... computed by firm\n\nPROPERTY B -- 9 Egret Landing Ct, Unit 304, Folly Beach, SC 29439   (held personally, NOT in the LLC)\n  Type: condo, short-term (avg stay 4 nights)    Personal use days: 19     Rented days: 141\n  Gross bookings ........................ 71,366.20\n  Platform fees ......................... 10,704.93\n  Cleaning (Darnell Whitlock, paid by Zelle -- 1099? see note 2) .... 8,460\n  HOA ................................... 7,200\n\nNOTES FROM CLIENT CALL 1/29/26\n1. Roof on A replaced after the storm. Sea Island Roofing & Sheet Metal inv. #SI-8821 dated\n   Sept. 9, 2025, $23,750.00. Insurance paid $15,000 of it in January 2026. Repair vs improvement?\n   Whole roof = improvement in my view. Ask Ignatius.\n2. Rafael paid Whitlock more than the threshold and has no W-9. Mr. Whitlock \"doesn't do paperwork.\"\n   Told Rafael to get it or we back-up withhold going forward. Whitlock cell per Rafael: (843) 555-0190.\n3. Mei-Ling qualifies as a real estate professional? She says 900+ hrs but also works 30 hrs/wk\n   as a dental hygienist. Not on these facts. Passive loss limits apply (Form 8582).\n4. Refund direct deposit: Lowcountry Federal checking, routing 053255064, account 20 4471 08836.\n5. Our fee ($1,650) to the card on file: Mastercard 5577-4144-8335-0067, exp. 04/27, code 339.\n   (Moved to the vault 2/3; shred this line.)\n6. Estimated payments made: 4/15 $3,000; 6/16 $3,000; 9/15 $3,000; 1/15/26 $4,500.", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "359 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Rafael Santos", "Mei-Ling Santos", "B. Kowalczyk", "Rafael", " Ignatius", "Mei-Ling"], "companies": ["Kowalczyk & Farrow CPAs, LLC", "Palmetto Coastal Property Management", "Lowcountry Federal Savings Bank", "Darnell Whitlock", "Zelle", "Santos Family Rentals LLC", "Sea Island Roofing & Sheet Metal", "Whitlock", "Lowcountry Federal"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.10000000149011612, "modelMs": 32957, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "passport_dl", "routing", "phone", "record", "vin", "account", "money", "dob", "age90", "date", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 28, "text": "Kowalczyk & Farrow CPAs, LLC", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Kowalczyk & Farrow CPAs, LLC"}, {"start": 161, "end": 173, "text": "B. Kowalczyk", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "B. Kowalczyk"}, {"start": 222, "end": 228, "text": "Rafael", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Rafael Santos"}, {"start": 238, "end": 249, "text": "502-39-8615", "kind": "ssn", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "502-39-8615"}, {"start": 258, "end": 268, "text": "11/02/1971", "kind": "dob", "source": "pattern"